s/images/page-img-62e87937b486a8.svg"/></div><div class="right-arrow w-slider-arrow-right"><img alt="arrow right" class="slider-arrow-image" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-7d7a86fb467f08.svg"/></div><div class="slide-nav w-slider-nav w-slider-nav-invert w-round"></div></div></div></div><div class="section bottom-padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="grid-layout"><div class="grid-layout-section-content"><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper left-padding right-padding"><p class="feature-paragraph">Enjoy the perfect combination of modern and authentic style. This is the ideal hideaway to enjoy a relaxing holiday with lots of character.</p></div><div class="divider _144px mobile-none"></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper right-padding"><div class="card-image-wapper medium-height"><img alt="" class="card-image" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-e025d0155b7425.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><p>Contemporary works of art by Leroy Brothers contrast against the earthy hues.</p></div></div></div><div class="grid-layout-section-content"><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper" data-w-id="9a2292a3-c1f2-9dae-ff8c-1931746eb56b"><div class="card-image-wapper-fixed small-height"><img alt="" class="card-image-fixed" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-c5bee3278b094a.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><p>A tranquil atmosphere reigns... just blend in.</p></div></div><div class="divider _96px mobile-none"></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper right-padding" data-w-id="9a2292a3-c1f2-9dae-ff8c-1931746eb577"><div class="card-image-wapper-fixed large-height"><img alt="" class="card-image-fixed" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-5f58d9ae0757af.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><p>Original furniture has been meticulously chosen.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section padding-96" style="background-color:#adb4a0"><div class=